# Dune Seven — redirects
# Old coaching-site URLs land on the new homepage instead of a dead 404.
#
# NOTE: Netlify serves real files first (index.html, sitemap.xml, robots.txt),
# so these rules only fire when nothing else matches. Your real pages are safe.

# Real pages — must resolve before the catch-all below
/privacy-policy     /privacy-policy.html     200

# Known old paths from the previous site
/m/*            /    301
/login          /    301
/m/login        /    301
/about          /    301
/about-us       /    301
/contact        /    301
/services       /    301
/programs       /    301
/coaching       /    301
/shop           /    301
/blog           /    301
/blog/*         /    301

# Catch-all — any other stale or unknown path goes to the homepage
/*              /    301
